Pahu̐"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":"81/2","first_line":"avatāra sāra","author":"Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur"},"title":["Avatāra Sāra"],"author":["by Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["avatāra sāra    gorā avatāra","    kena nā bhajili tā̐re","kari’ nīre vāsa    gela nā piyāsa","    āpana karama phere"],"translation":["Śrī Gaura Avatār is the best of all Avatārs. Why don’t you serve Him? O mind, you resided beside water, but did not quench your thirst. You returned to your selfishness."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["kaṇṭakera taru    sadāi sevili (mana)","    amṛta pā’bāra āśe","prema-kalpataru    śrī gaurāṅga āmāra","    tāhāre bhavili viṣe"],"translation":["O mind, desiring to drink nectar, you constantly chewed thorned wood (and mistook the blood in your mouth for nectar). My Lord Gaurāṅga is a wish-fulfilling tree of divine love, but you considered Him to be poison."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["saurabhera āśe    palāśa ś.kili (mana)","    nāsāte paśila kīṭa","‘ikṣu-daṇḍa’ bhāvi’    kāṭha chuṣili (mana)","    kemane pāibi miṭha"],"translation":["O mind, seeking a fragrance, you smelled the odourless palāśa flower, and insects entered your nose. O mind, considering it sugarcane, you sucked dry wood. How will you taste sweetness in this way?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["‘hāra’ baliyā    galāya parili (mana)","    śamana kiṅkara sāpa","‘śītala’ baliyā    āguna pohāli (mana)","    pāili vajara-tāpa"],"translation":["O mind, considering it a necklace, you wore death’s attendant serpent around your neck. O mind, considering it to be cooling, you embraced fire and received a scorching burn."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["saṁsāra bhajili    śrī-gaurāṅga bhulili","    nā śunili sādhura kathā","iha-parakāla    dukāla khoyāli (mana)","    khāili āpana māthā"],"translation":["You served your family (mundane ends), forgot Śrī Gaurāṅga, and never listened to the sādhus’ words. O mind, you wasted both this life and your next life. You depraved yourself."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/24-avatara-sara-gaura-avatara-4","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/acharya-maharaj-avatara-sara","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/avatara-sara","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-avatara-sara","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Avatāra-Sāra-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/avatara-sara-gora-avatara/","description":"Avatāra Sāra — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Avatāra Sāra. by Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"avatara-sara-gora-avatara"}}